{"2521510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "PartySaur: Dino Mayhem", "steam_appid": 2521510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521510/extras/a702daf17f8be97e42c83a22608fa371.avif?t=1775848554\" width=473 height=276 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Welcome to PartySaur: Dino Mayhem, an exciting multiplayer party game where your skill will get you to victory, and you can help your favorite Dino claim he title of BEST DINO!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521510/extras/6433ed92fe878d2b089ee765494edce5.avif?t=1775848554\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521510/extras_big/6433ed92fe878d2b089ee765494edce5.webp?t=1775848554 width=1560 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521510/extras/40520ce0bab60b79188338185601e394.poster.avif?t=1775848554\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521510/extras/40520ce0bab60b79188338185601e394.webm?t=1775848554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521510/extras/40520ce0bab60b79188338185601e394.mp4?t=1775848554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A fast paced ~15 minutes board game mode where you can compete against your friends in back to back minigames to reach the finish line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521510/extras/117b6944ecd99228a95dd20f8e30ad4e.poster.avif?t=1775848554\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521510/extras/117b6944ecd99228a95dd20f8e30ad4e.webm?t=1775848554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521510/extras/117b6944ecd99228a95dd20f8e30ad4e.mp4?t=1775848554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Pick any minigame, jump straight into the madness, and settle scores, or just practice causing trouble!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521510/extras/61e3c1a78627292c72c86677b8ed8a9a.avif?t=1775848554\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521510/extras_big/61e3c1a78627292c72c86677b8ed8a9a.webp?t=1775848554 width=1560 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521510/extras/720eafb9dee11cbc5838820e40af820a.poster.avif?t=1775848554\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521510/extras/720eafb9dee11cbc5838820e40af820a.webm?t=1775848554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521510/extras/720eafb9dee11cbc5838820e40af820a.mp4?t=1775848554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Challenge your friends in 12+ exciting and chaotic minigames that will test your skill (and maybe your friendship). Survive the great rain of rocks in &quot;Eruption&quot;, avoid the dangerous Triceratops in &quot;Stampede&quot;, and many others!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521510/extras/63c3737653adec2bd8544cad19b72262.avif?t=1775848554\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521510/extras_big/63c3737653adec2bd8544cad19b72262.webp?t=1775848554 width=1560 height=266 /></span>  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521510/extras/c9335e72f505e2370904b94a832363b7.avif?t=1775848554\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Pick your favorite Dino among many funny, quirky and unique roster! (they even have a pet rock!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521510/extras/ada87bcec7a7ac5823cc897b85a347c6.avif?t=1775848554\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521510/extras_big/ada87bcec7a7ac5823cc897b85a347c6.webp?t=1775848554 width=1560 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521510/extras/9552c8ac815cfb2178bc369e46d20019.poster.avif?t=1775848554\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521510/extras/9552c8ac815cfb2178bc369e46d20019.webm?t=1775848554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521510/extras/9552c8ac815cfb2178bc369e46d20019.mp4?t=1775848554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Immerse yourself in the fun, up to 4 players can enjoy the multiplayer experience locally or through Remote Play. Only a skilled player will overcome each challenging minigames and be crowned the undisputed winner! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Do you have what it takes?</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521510/extras/a702daf17f8be97e42c83a22608fa371.avif?t=1775848554\" width=473 height=276 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Welcome to PartySaur: Dino Mayhem, an exciting multiplayer party game where your skill will get you to victory, and you can help your favorite Dino claim he title of BEST DINO!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521510/extras/6433ed92fe878d2b089ee765494edce5.avif?t=1775848554\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521510/extras_big/6433ed92fe878d2b089ee765494edce5.webp?t=1775848554 width=1560 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521510/extras/40520ce0bab60b79188338185601e394.poster.avif?t=1775848554\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521510/extras/40520ce0bab60b79188338185601e394.webm?t=1775848554\" 